  "definition": "Who May Request a Waiver",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-09-01",
  "historyNote": "#7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3903.02); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
